// Insult messages start at 3000. Each class gets 50 messages starting
// on multiples of 50

// noble
{3000}{The inbreeding is obvious in your case.}
{3001}{If ignorance is bliss, you must be the happiest person alive.}
{3002}{You possess an intellect rivaled by garden tools.}
{3003}{You are a slimy, snivelling, belly-wriggling invertebrate!}
{3004}{You madam, are a palsied, pusillanimous blueblood.}
{3005}{You are depriving a village somewhere of an idiot.}
{3006}{You are a classic case of cranio-rectal inversion.}
{3007}{You are mercifully free of the ravages of intelligence.}
{3008}{You have serious delusions of adequacy.}
{3009}{You are as charming as a dead mouse in a loaf of bread.}

// priest
{3050}{You should do some soul-searching, maybe you will find one.}
{3051}{You have a brain of feathers, and a heart of lead.}
{3052}{You seem to be a self-made man who worships his creator.}
{3053}{In place of a heart, you carry a tumor of rotten principles.}
{3054}{There's nothing wrong with you that reincarnation won't fix.}
{3055}{Is your job devoted to spreading ignorance?}
{3056}{You have a soft heart . . . and a head to match.}

// wizard
{3100}{Magick must addle the brain, because you are quite the dimwit.}
{3101}{There is nothing blowing across the windmills of your mind.}
{3102}{You are nothing but a trellis for varicose veins.}
{3103}{I have seen people like you before, but I had to pay admission.}
{3104}{Ideas just seem to echo between your ears.}
{3105}{You are on permanent leave of your senses.}
{3106}{I see you use your head to keep the rain out of your neck.}
{3107}{You are a legend in your own mind.}
{3108}{You have a mind so fine that no idea could violate it.}
{3109}{Listening to you is like wading through glue.}
{3110}{You are all sound and no sense.}
{3111}{Nobody can make a fool out of you. You did it all by yourself.}

// technologist
