{3157}{Your mind is so open that ideas simply pass clean through it.}
{3158}{You have diarrhea of the mouth, and constipation of the ideas.}
{3159}{You are about as sharp as the leading edge of a ball bearing.}
{3160}{Your imagination resembles the wings of an ostrich.}

